<\body>
  <tmdoc-title|Interfacing <TeXmacs> with other programs>

  This is an older introduction to the interfacing of <TeXmacs> with extern
  programs. A more complete and more up to date description can be found in
  the chapters on <hlink|the <TeXmacs> plug-in system|plugins.en.tm> and on
  <hlink|interfacing <TeXmacs> with other
  programs|../interface/interface.en.tm>.

